  "deck": "An evidence-based look at what niacinamide does for barrier function after 40 — what the research supports, what it doesn't, and how to use it without irritation.",
  "description": "A plain-language, evidence-based explainer on niacinamide and the aging skin barrier: how it supports barrier function after 40, what studies actually show, and how to use it without irritation.",
  "editorial": {
    "framework": "hook → context → explanation → proof → myth → step → summary",
    "writer_notes": "Evidence-based barrier explainer for skin after 40. Distinct from the general 'Niacinamide, plainly' primer: barrier + aging focus, honest about limits. Draft only — do not publish. Concentration and study ranges kept qualitative/approximate; verify before any publish."
